{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12343","headline":"送鲍中丞赴太原军营 · 钱起","name":"送鲍中丞赴太原军营","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年壮才仍美，时来道易行。\n宠兼三独任，威肃贰师营。\n将略过南仲，天心寄北京。\n云旗临塞色，龙笛出关声。\n汉月随霜去，边尘计日清。\n渐知王事好，文武用书生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12343.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12343","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}